    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown1.webp",
      "alt": "showdown1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown2.webp",
      "alt": "showdown2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay...can someone explain to me what’s going on here?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was under the impression that I was going to the movies with Ami.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We are going to the movies! I just need to kick Ayane’s butt in a cooking competition first!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, please! As if I’d let you win a competition as important as this!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This might be the only chance I ever get to directly compete against you for Sensei's heart! I will not let you take this from me!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei doesn’t want your bubble wrap empire, Ayane!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neither do I so that's just one more thing we have in common!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So, here we are...The ultimate showdown between Ami and Ayane- two [teenage]girls giving all they have to impress three of us (But mostly me) with their cooking.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm a little worried about giving Ayane access to so many knives during a battle in which my love is the prize...but I figure I’ll be able to step in if she does decide to get all...’Ayane.’",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown3.webp",
      "alt": "showdown3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...thank you again...for inviting me over...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry to...intrude like this...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's fine. Make yourself at home.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what is this? When did you two start warming up to one another? Why are so many strange things happening today?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown4.webp",
      "alt": "showdown4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": U-Umm...Sensei...has been coming to the bar I work at recently and...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He’s been helping me...get more comfortable around other people...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown5.webp",
      "alt": "showdown5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that so?...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t realize he was actually capable of instructing anyone in ways that don't directly benefit him.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everyone benefits from a more talkative Sana. She is a welcome investment of my time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, blink twice if you are being forced to comply against your will.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm...not a hostage! Sensei has...actually helped a lot!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve only cried a couple times so far!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown6.webp",
      "alt": "showdown6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Was telling her that part really necessary?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...because you’ve only cried a couple times, you think he’s doing a good job?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See? Now she's just going to use that against us and you're never going to learn how to talk.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm sorry...I...I...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, if you really want help when it comes to communicating, let me handle it. I can guarantee you I'll be of more assistance than him.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown7.webp",
      "alt": "showdown7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We're trying to teach her how to talk to other people, not how to make them feel insignificant and unwelcome.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...think Sensei...is doing a good job...and um...I think...I'm going to stay...with him...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You will regret this decision, but it is yours to make.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did...um...something happen between you two?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You seem...a little different outside of school...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t mind them, Sana! Those two are never going to get along. Me and Ayane have already accepted it.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ami calls out from the kitchen and sums up the relationship between Maya and me pretty perfectly.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t know if I’d go as far as saying that we’ll never get along, though...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya will have to warm up to me some day, right?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Right?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown2.webp",
      "alt": "showdown2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How much longer do we need to wait until this competition actually begins? I'm starving and I envisioned myself with several buckets full of popcorn by now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're gonna have to ask Ayane. She's the one who's supposed to be going-",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Silence! And fear no more, Maya! For the first course of several unbelievable courses is about to be served...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown8.webp",
      "alt": "showdown8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ll be starting today off light and indulging in our wonderful culture with a staple of nearly every Japanese dish...rice.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": While it may not be the most exciting food item you will be eating today, it's important to remember that good rice can elevate a dish to unbelievable levels!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And even though it may seem simple, there are countless different ways to use it and even more ways to-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm sorry, is the monologue part of the dish? Or am I allowed to eat now?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown8r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown8r.webp",
      "alt": "showdown8r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You may eat! But please remember to like, comment, and subscribe if you enjoy it!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown9.webp",
      "alt": "showdown9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Subscribe to...rice?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This seems like a lot of rice, Ayane. I don't really think any of us want to fill up on-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown10.webp",
      "alt": "showdown10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Seconds, please.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown11.webp",
      "alt": "showdown11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ayane’s rice is...well, rice.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s cooked properly and not seasoned in any way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s just...a typical side dish you'd receive at a restaurant alongside miso soup.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That said, I couldn't really find any issues with it either. So I guess this sort of...simplistic form of cooking is in line with how Ayane likes to do things.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown12.webp",
      "alt": "showdown12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hi, everyone! Did you all enjoy Ayane's first dish? Or do you think it was super boring and that she should get locked inside of a shed somewhere?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! You can’t ask questions like that in the middle of the competition! It’s unfair!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Deduct points from her score!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please ignore the loud noises coming from the kitchen. Our ice machine broke and has been making a strange whining sound all morning.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami! You know I hate it when you compare me to industrial appliances!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown13.webp",
      "alt": "showdown13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway! Please enjoy my version of Ayane’s super boring dish but with an extra special ingredient! Thank you very much for your time and remember to vote Ami!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown14.webp",
      "alt": "showdown14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you both looking at me?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We want to watch how you eat.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...also curious...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown16.webp",
      "alt": "showdown16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t know...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just...kind of impressive, don’t you th-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown10.webp",
      "alt": "showdown10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Seconds, please.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown17.webp",
      "alt": "showdown17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wha-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We looked away for too long...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It...was only a couple seconds...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I honestly don't understand what you two are so riled up about. I'm just doing the same thing I always do.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are...always like this?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just leave it alone, Sana. She's a monster...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ami’s rice is...also rice.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "However, just like she hinted at, there’s an extra special ingredient in it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And that ingredient?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is love.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just kidding. It’s salt.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ami must have salted the rice before bringing it to us, which I greatly appreciate since I put salt on virtually everything.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And just like that, we have our first example of her directly catering to my tastes without thinking about what the other judges will think.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/showdown18.webp",
      "alt": "showdown18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...what do you think, Sensei?...Which one was better?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami, without a doubt.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane’s rice was probably cooked a little better. But without any seasoning, I just can't say I'd choose it over Ami's.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! You know that salt is bad for your heart, don't you? For the sake of your health, I think you should lay off.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How do you expect to raise our children with your sodium levels through the roof?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stop trying to raise a family with my [uncle]!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Uhh.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway...I think I liked...Ayane’s more...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene showdown5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
